OL,3,GNEWSAEnvironmental groups critical of
OL,4,Ahousing levy idea
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnvironmental groups have criticised a
OL,7,Fpilot scheme that aims to make housing
OL,8,Fdevelopers pay a new nature levy.
OL,10,FThe government wants parts of Norfolk
OL,11,Fto be the first areas subject to its
OL,12,FEnvironmental Delivery Plan (EDP).
OL,14,FIn order to unlock space for thousands
OL,15,Fof homes, developers would pay money
OL,16,Fthat could create new wetlands, fund
OL,17,Fdeer culls and restore rivers.
OL,19,FBut ecology experts fear that it would
OL,20,Ffail to tackle the sources of
OL,21,Fpollution, leaving vulnerable chalk
OL,22,Fstreams still at risk.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
